t is directed  by kerry skoglund while the three actors  anthony mackie sebastian stan and daniel  bruil naturally return to their old  familiar roles  if you want to get a first glimpse you  can watch the newly released first  trailer on  our channel the official release date is  march 19th  2021 the first movie of phase four  is in the early summer of 2021 and will  be called  black widow most recently natasha  romanov alias black widow appeared in  avengers ant game  the unresolved questions left by her  appearance in the marvel story will then  be answered in this standalone film  this will include a reunion with other  black widows however  an encounter with the captain america  counterpart greg guardian is also said  to be coming up  shedding light on the past of the  russian top spy scarlett johansson  florence pew  and david harbour are cast in the lead  roles while kate shortland directs the  film  are you looking forward to the first mcu  movie of phase 4  may 7th 2021 will finally be the big day  the series loki with tom hiddleston and  on wilson is also planned for may 2021  in six episodes everything will revolve  around thor's brother who travels  through different timelines  to his time travels he changes the  course of human history quite  dramatically  in the process he stirs up quite a bit  of chaos and quickly has to bother with  the time variance agency or tva for  short  an exact release date in may is not yet  known but as soon as it is  we'll of course let you know in our  weekly news  next up is changshi and the legends of  the 10 rings  this particular movie is about the  adventures of changshi the master of  kung fu and it is indeed the first  of the mcu to feature an asian main  character  xiangxi is actually the son of the  villain fu manchu who instructs him in  martial arts  eventually however he decides not to  follow in his father's footsteps and  becomes a hero  instead of a villain of course as the  title suggests the mysterious tan rings  organization  also plays a major role by the way the  organization was first present in the  first  iron man movie when they kidnapped tony  stark starring simul you  tony chi wai yang and aquafina the  release date is july 9th  2021 another new addition to the mcu is  the fully animated  what if series it covers many different  alternate timelines of well-known  storylines  for instance what if loki's plan had  worked out in thor  or what if captain america had turned  into a zombie we are definitely excited  to see a lot of  peculiar crazy scenarios that we  otherwise would have never seen in the  mcu  the series will be coming to disney plus  in the summer of 2021  after the avengers made their last  glorious appearance on phase 3  a new collective is now entering phase 4  of the mcu  namely the eternals in short there are  race of immortal beings who step  seeker's presence on earth dates backs  countless years however tragedy forces  them to step out of the shadows  and fight against their greatest enemies  the deviants  the mix of top-notch cast and the  exciting storyline is sure to lure many  fans to the front of the screens  the expected start date is scheduled for  november 5th 2021  the friendly spider from the  neighborhood will also return next year  after a brilliant finale in spider-man  far from home  plenty of things will change in the  upcoming spider-man 3.  to begin with there's the spectacular  reunion of the first two spider-man toby  maguire and andrew garfield with tom  holland but major supporting characters  are also expected to return in this  multiverse blockbuster  including kirsten dunst as mary jane  watson jamie foxx as villain electro  alfred molina as doc ock  and charlie cox as daredevil from the  netflix series of the same name  it is not yet clear in what way the  appearance of the familiar faces will  take place  but we are definitely looking forward to  the release of the live-action version  of the legendary spider-man meme on  december 17  2021 also planned for  2021 is a hawkeye series set after the  events of avengers  end game clint barton who will again be  played by jeremy renner  gets accustomed to his new life as a  ronin and henceforth to act as a mentor  for the young kate bishop  played by haley steinfeld first  impressions could be gathered from  pictures of the shooting in a new york  subway station  it has been considered certain ever  since that steinfeld will actually slip  into the role of cape bishop are you  already excited about the long-awaited  hawkeye series  it is expected to release in the second  half of 2021  the focus of the next series scheduled  for 2021 is kamala khan  16 year old american with pakistani  ancestry this straight a student is not  only an avid video game fan but also the  first muslim marvel heroine to get her  own movie more or less by chance  she then discovers her superpowers which  come mainly with the sheer endless  stretching ability of her extremities  from then on just like a role model  captain marvel she provides law and  order in jersey city  the fourth spin-off of the thor series  is called love and thunder and is  scheduled for release in 2022  the plot is based on the mighty thor  comic and thus also features a female  thor  jane foster played by natalie portman  after thor had left the scene with  guardians at the end of avengers endgame  many fans are also eager to know what  happens next with him  by february 11th 2022 you will be more  in the know about this  after thor we continue with a sequel to  doctor strange from  2016. as the title implies we can  probably expect a huge expansion of the  mcu  unusual for an mcu movie is especially  the idea to conceive the film as a kind  of  horror movie primarily responsible for  this is sam raimi  in front of the camera will be seen  among others benedict cumberbatch as  doctor strange elizabeth olsen as wanda  and chewie jellyfor as baron mordo the  start day so far has been set for march  25th  2022 in conclusion we present you two  undated series from phase four  she-hulk and moon knight the first  mansion series explores the life of  bruce banner's cousin jennifer walters  as a female hulk  while the rather dark moon knight series  is about the former mercenary who holds  multiple personalities  and is steeped in the powers of an  egyptian deity both series don't have a  fixed relay state as of yet but as soon  as that changes  we will inform you as always so that's  it already with the upcoming projects  from phase 4 of the mcu  which movie or series are you most  looking forward to  feel free to write it down in the  comments  [Music]  foreign

